    },
    "Take it out" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entnehmen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take out" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entnehmen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the %@ out? Its %@ come off the tab — for something binned or given away. Eating one is the swipe." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ entnehmen? Die %@ werden vom Bestand abgezogen — für etwas, das weggeworfen oder verschenkt wurde. Eine Portion essen geht per Wisch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap an ingredient to set its aisle, staple flag, or whether the premium version is worth it. %@ marks a staple — it stays off the shopping list until the staples check." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tippe auf eine Zutat, um Gang, Vorrats-Flag oder das Preisurteil zu setzen. %@ markiert einen Vorrat — er bleibt von der Einkaufsliste, bis du vor dem Einkauf die Vorräte prüfst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the built-in walk, fruit & veg first" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "der eingebaute Lauf, Obst & Gemüse zuerst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalogue needs the server — it'll be here when you're back online." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Katalog braucht den Server — er erscheint, sobald du wieder online bist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The label is how this week shows up in your past plans." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Name zeigt diese Woche später unter deinen früheren Plänen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The label is how you'll recognise it in the list when it's time to revoke it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Name hilft dir, es in der Liste zu erkennen, wenn es Zeit ist, es zu widerrufen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list uses the built-in aisle order until you save the stores you actually shop at and arrange their walks." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Liste nutzt die eingebaute Gang-Reihenfolge, bis du deine Läden speicherst und ihre Läufe ordnest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new passwords don't match." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die neuen Passwörter stimmen nicht überein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the plan" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "dem Plan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The prompt pack" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Prompt-Pack"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the recipe's own" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Originalmenge des Rezepts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shopping list follows the change: new ingredients appear, removed ones come off. Things you've already ticked off stay ticked." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Einkaufsliste folgt der Änderung: neue Zutaten erscheinen, entfernte verschwinden. schon Abgehaktes bleibt abgehakt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shopping list walks the aisles in the ticked store's order — every device (and your AI) sorts for it. Tap a store's aisles to arrange its walk." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Einkaufsliste folgt den Gängen im angehakten Laden — jedes Gerät (und deine KI) sortiert danach. Tippe auf die Gänge eines Ladens, um seinen Lauf zu ordnen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The skill" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Skill"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The survivor keeps its own aisle, staple flag and verdict." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die verbleibende Zutat behält Gang, Vorrats-Flag und Preisurteil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These meals still use this recipe: %@. Remove it from them first, then delete the recipe." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Mahlzeiten nutzen das Rezept noch: %@. Entferne es erst dort, dann lösche das Rezept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They get the invites and the guest list. You become an ordinary member — still able to change every recipe, plan and list, as everyone here is." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Person bekommt Einladungen und Gästeliste. Du wirst ein ganz normales Mitglied — und kannst wie alle hier jedes Rezept, jeden Plan und jede Liste ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das lässt sich nicht rückgängig machen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This meal" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Mahlzeit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plan was wrapped up without any meals." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Plan wurde ohne Mahlzeiten abgeschlossen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server is too old to list who's in your household. Update the server to see it here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Server ist zu alt, um die Mitglieder deines Haushalts anzuzeigen. Aktualisiere den Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this token" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "dieses Token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version of Meals is too old for the server (it needs build %lld, this is build %lld). Update to carry on — anything you've ticked off or added is saved and will sync." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Meals-Version ist zu alt für den Server (er braucht Build %lld, das hier ist Build %lld). Aktualisiere, um weiterzumachen — alles Abgehakte oder Hinzugefügte ist gesichert und wird synchronisiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version of Meals is too old for the server." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Meals-Version ist zu alt für den Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This week's options" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optionen für diese Woche"
