        }
      }
    },
    "Title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Titel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To rename, tap the name at the top — every recipe and list line follows it, and if the new name already exists the two fold together. Merge is for duplicates spelled too differently for the finder — 'beef mince' next to 'minced beef'." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Umbenennen: tippe oben auf den Namen — jedes Rezept und jede Listzeile folgt. Gibt es den neuen Namen schon, verschmelzen beide. Zusammenführen ist für Duplikate, deren Schreibweisen zu weit auseinanderliegen — „Rinderhack“ neben „Hackfleisch“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erneut versuchen"
