    "We'll email a reset code if that address has an account here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Falls zu dieser Adresse ein Konto gehört, schicken wir einen Reset-Code per E-Mail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is it" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was ist es"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is it (e.g. Mum's lasagne)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was ist es (z. B. Omas Lasagne)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "what's already cooked and waiting" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "was schon gekocht ist und wartet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's in the freezer?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was ist im Gefrierfach?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you batch-cook, put the spare portions here and this becomes the answer to “what's for tea?”." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du vorkochst, landen die übrigen Portionen hier — und das Gefrierfach beantwortet „Was gibt's heute Abend?“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "whoever leads it" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "wer auch immer ihn führt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why? e.g. the cheap stuff goes bitter" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warum? z. B. die billige Ware wird bitter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worth paying up for" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aufpreis wert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrapped up %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abgeschlossen am %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You keep this account and everything signed in on it — only which household you're in changes. “%@” keeps its recipes unless you're its only member, in which case they go with you." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du behältst dieses Konto und alles, was darin angemeldet ist — es ändert sich nur der Haushalt. „%@“ behält seine Rezepte, es sei denn, du bist das einzige Mitglied — dann nimmst du sie mit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline and there's no saved copy of the plan yet." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist offline, und es gibt noch keine gespeicherte Kopie des Plans."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist offline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're still signed in here. Any other device will need the new password." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hier bleibst du angemeldet. Alle anderen Geräte brauchen das neue Passwort."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data lives here, and nowhere else. Sign out to connect to a different server." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Daten liegen hier und nirgendwo sonst. Zum Wechsel des Servers melde dich ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Name"
          }
        }
      }
